                "source": "Twitter Web App",
                "text": "When I spoke with local corrections officers, I heard how the fentanyl epidemic and lacking behavioral health resources make their jobs more difficult.\n\nTheir sacrifice often goes unrecognized, yet it's a vital public service, so I'm using tonight's Presidential address to honor their hard work.",
