                "retweet_count": 10,
                "source": "Twitter Web App",
                "text": "Taking care of your health, newborn, or family when they\u2019re most in need shouldn\u2019t come at the cost of paying the bills.\n\nStrong families mean strong communities and local economies.\n\nWith the paid family and medical leave tax credit due to expire, my bipartisan bill will make it permanent and expand access for WA-based businesses and newer employees, so more folks can benefit.",
