                "source": "Twitter for iPhone",
                "text": "Correction officers are core to our justice system, yet they receive little recognition for the difficult work they do.\n\nBy strengthening mental health resources for officers and ensuring detainees access addiction treatment, we can help them do their jobs more safely and effectively. #NationalPoliceWeek",
