                "retweet_count": 5,
                "source": "Twitter Web App",
                "text": "As law enforcement face increased pressures from the fentanyl crisis, it's more difficult to recruit and retain officers.\n\nWe need to ensure they have the childcare, mental health support, and resources needed to stay safe at work and enjoy time with their families.\n\nThank you to @NAPOpolice for your advocacy and for having me for #NationalPoliceWeek.",
