                "source": "Twitter Web App",
                "text": "It\u2019s an incomplete picture to just look at trade deficits or prices instead of also standing by hardworking people who provide value to their neighbors and drive our economies.\n\nWe can address wealth inequality and strengthen our national health when we empower farmers to sell to their communities and cut red tape that makes it harder for them to compete with the big guys.",
