                "retweet_count": 9,
                "source": "Twitter Web App",
                "text": "When new families have fewer infant formula options \u2013 it poses a risk to their pocketbooks, the reliability of our supply chains, and, most importantly, the health of our infants.\n\nThe Appropriations Committee passed my amendment to investigate the impact of consolidation in the infant formula industry \u2013 and it was one of only five amendments from Democrats to pass.",
