                "text": "Strong local ag supply chains are how we combat farm consolidation, support national health, and increase our self-sufficiency as a nation.\n\nI visited the opening of the SW WA Ag Innovation Park \u2013 an incredible community-led effort to bring market access and support to local growers \u2013 and I'm glad I was able to bring our funds home to support it!",
