                "quoted_status_profile_id": null,
                "quoted_status_profile_username": null,
                "reply_count": 11,
                "retweet_count": 3,
                "source": "Twitter for iPhone",
                "text": "I\u2019m glad to work with my colleagues on both sides of the aisle to bring down health care costs. Nobody wants to shell out more cash to insurance companies or PBM middlemen.  \n\nAt the same time, we can\u2019t lose sight of the fact that national health doesn\u2019t come from insurance coverage \u2014 it hinges on people having good jobs, being able to sleep 8 hours a night, cook real food and see their kids at night. Affordable healthcare and medicine are imperative and worth the fight, but a strong nation is longer work.",
